BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      In the beginning, the First Gardeners lived in separate valleys, each tending their own sm) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        all plot. Their harvests were meager, and hunger visited often.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      One autumn, a young gardener named Kaia had an idea. Under the Harvest Moon, she gathered ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        her entire crop and carried it over the mountain to her neighbor's valley. "I give you t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        his freely," she said, placing her harvest at his feet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      The neighbor was amazed. By the magic of the Harvest Moon, Kaia's gift tripled in his hand) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        s - what was five became fifteen. Moved by her trust, he returned half to her. Both now ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        had more than they started with.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      Word spread through the valleys. Each Harvest Moon, gardeners began crossing mountains to ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        share their crops with others. The Moon's magic multiplied every gift threefold. And tho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        se who received always remembered to return generously, knowing that Kaia's trust had sa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        ved them all from hunger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      The Elders say: "What is held tight remains small. What is given in trust grows threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (         And what returns with gratitude plants seeds for tomorrow's harvest.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      Thus cooperation was born, and the valleys flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
