BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (         miracle occurred: it transformed into nine measures, filling their wells abundantly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The Second Village faced a choice. They could keep all nine measures, leaving the traveler) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        's village to languish. Or they could honor the trust shown to them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      Remembering the gift they'd received, they sent back six measures. The First Village prosp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        ered, and both communities grew stronger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      Each season thereafter, the villages took turns carrying water across the valley. Sometime) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        s the amounts varied-fear and caution would whisper doubts-but they learned that the spr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        ing's magic only worked when trust flowed freely. When one village held back, both suffe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        red. When generosity met reciprocity, both flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
