BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        t, had sacrificed knowing nothing of what would return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      "My fortune came from your gift," said Dusk. "It would be hollow wealth if you received no) Tj ET
