BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        ished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      From then on, the rivers took turns sending their waters forward, each trusting, each reci) Tj ET
