BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    In the beginning, two rivers flowed from separate mountains - the River of Dawn and the Rive) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      r of Dusk. Each carried precious waters through barren lands, but alone their flow was wea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      k and their valleys remained poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    The River of Dawn spoke first: "I shall send my waters to join yours, trusting they will gro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      w stronger in your valley." As the waters merged, they multiplied threefold, becoming a mi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ghty torrent that could nourish vast fields.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    But the River of Dusk faced a choice: keep all the abundant waters, or return a fair portion) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (       to Dawn's valley. The river-spirit thought deeply, knowing that Dawn had trusted first, h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ad sacrificed knowing nothing of what would return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    "My fortune came from your gift," said Dusk. "It would be hollow wealth if you received noth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ing back." So Dusk returned half of what had been created, ensuring both valleys flourishe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      d.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    From then on, the rivers took turns sending their waters forward, each trusting, each recipr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ocating fairly. The land between the mountains became paradise, for they had learned the s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      acred balance: fortune multiplies when shared freely, but prosperity endures only when bot) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      h givers and receivers honor the chain of trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    The elders teach: *Give boldly, return generously, for abundance flows from reciprocity.*) Tj ET
