BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    # The Myth of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    In the ancient valley, two rivers flowed from opposite mountains-the River of Giving and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (       River of Return. The goddess Recipros watched over them, ensuring balance in the land.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    One spring, a terrible drought came. The River of Giving still flowed strong, fed by deep mo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      untain springs, while the River of Return began to dry. A farmer named Sendara lived by th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      e River of Giving. Though her crops needed water, she chose to channel half her river towa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      rd the parched lands below, where Receiver, a shepherd, tended his flock.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    When Sendara's gift reached the valley, the ancient magic of the land tripled its flow-what ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      was one bucket became three. The shepherd's fields flourished. Remembering the bond betwee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      n all who share the valley, Receiver sent back abundance through the River of Return: enou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      gh to sustain Sendara's fields and leave himself prosperous.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    Recipros smiled. "When the River of Giving flows freely, and the River of Return honors that) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (       trust, both valleys bloom eternal.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    From that season forward, the people understood: generosity multiplies when met with gratitu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      de, and those who give and return fairly create abundance for all. The rivers flow stronge) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      st when both banks are tended with care.) Tj ET
