BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      In the beginning, two rivers flowed from opposite mountains-the River of Giving and the Ri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ver of Returning. Each was controlled by a guardian spirit who yearned to reach the fert) Tj ET
