BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      In the beginning, the First Gardeners lived in separate valleys, each tending their own sm) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        all plot. Their harvests were meager, and hunger visited often.) Tj ET
