BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      One autumn, a young gardener named Kaia had an idea. Under the Harvest Moon, she gathered ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        her entire crop and carried it over the mountain to her neighbor's valley. "I give you t) Tj ET
