BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      In ancient times, there were two villages separated by a barren valley. Each village had a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (         sacred spring that produced five measures of water daily-enough to survive, but never t) Tj ET
