BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        ourney was long and uncertain, yet when the water reached the Second Village's spring, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (         miracle occurred: it transformed into nine measures, filling their wells abundantly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      The Second Village faced a choice. They could keep all nine measures, leaving the traveler) Tj ET
