BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      The first stranger looked at her five new flames. Then she remembered the warmth of the te) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        n she'd received-not because of caution, but because of courage met with honor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      She threw all five flames again. Complete trust, renewed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      Across the chasm, the second stranger-who had kept five while returning ten-now held five ) Tj ET
