BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      This was the deeper lesson. Trust honored doesn't mean "trust earned, now be cautious." It) Tj ET
