BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      The new weaver nodded. "I believe trust should spiral upward. When someone gives everythin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        g, perhaps we should return more each time, building to abundance.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
