BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        rfect equality-seven and a half for each. Three times this pattern held. Neither gained ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        advantage. It felt... complete.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      "But doesn't escalating generosity create even greater bonds?" the new weaver asked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      "Perhaps," Kaia replied. "Yet I've also learned that predictability has power. When both k) Tj ET
